        "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ZOORYN — Bandeau Trustpilot (au-dessus des temoignages)\n  Pour modifier la note ou le nombre d'avis : les deux variables ci-dessous.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign tp_note = '4,8/5' -%}\n{%- assign tp_avis = '3 214' -%}\n\n<div class=\"zx-tp\">\n  <span class=\"zx-tp__brand\">\n    <svg class=\"zx-tp__star\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <path fill=\"#00B67A\" d=\"M12 1.8l3.1 7.1 7.7.6-5.9 5.1 1.8 7.6L12 18.1 5.3 22.2l1.8-7.6L1.2 9.5l7.7-.6z\"/>\n    </svg>\n    <span class=\"zx-tp__name\">Trustpilot</span>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"zx-tp__copy\">\n    <strong class=\"zx-tp__note\">Note de {{ tp_note }}</strong>\n    <span class=\"zx-tp__mid\">bas&eacute;e sur plus</span>\n    <span class=\"zx-tp__count\">de {{ tp_avis }} avis</span>\n  </span>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .zx-tp{\n    display:flex;\n    flex-wrap:wrap;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    gap:10px 12px;\n    padding:14px 16px 0;\n    line-height:1.2;\n    font-size:16px;\n  }\n\n  .zx-tp__brand{\n    display:inline-flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    gap:5px;\n  }\n  .zx-tp__star{ width:20px; height:20px; display:block; flex:0 0 20px; }\n  .zx-tp__name{\n    font-weight:700;\n    color:#191919;\n    letter-spacing:-.01em;\n  }\n\n  .zx-tp__copy{\n    display:inline-flex;\n    flex-wrap:wrap;\n    align-items:center;\n    gap:6px;\n  }\n  .zx-tp__note{ color:#00B67A; font-weight:700; }\n  .zx-tp__mid{ color:#191919; font-weight:500; }\n  .zx-tp__count{\n    color:#00B67A;\n    font-weight:700;\n    text-decoration:underline;\n    text-underline-offset:3px;\n    text-decoration-thickness:2px;\n  }\n\n  @media(max-width:600px){\n    .zx-tp{ font-size:14px; gap:8px 10px; }\n    .zx-tp__star{ width:18px; height:18px; flex:0 0 18px; }\n  }\n</style>",
